<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Apertura sala sopra — Big Ben</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f5f4f0;--surface:#fff;--border:#e2ddd8;--text:#1a1714;--text2:#6b6560;--text3:#a09890;--accent:#c8392b;--green:#2a7a4b;--green-light:#edf7f2;}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
body{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);min-height:100vh;}
header{background:var(--text);padding:0 28px;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.logo-mark{width:26px;height:26px;background:var(--accent);border-radius:5px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;}
.logo-text{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#fff;}
.back-btn{font-size:12px;color:#666;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;}
.back-btn:hover{color:#fff;}
.container{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 24px 80px;}
.proc-header{margin-bottom:28px;}
.proc-icon-big{font-size:42px;margin-bottom:10px;display:block;}
.badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:20px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.badge.attiva{background:var(--green-light);color:var(--green);}
.badge.bozza{background:#f0ede8;color:var(--text3);}
.proc-title{font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.5px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:5px;}
.proc-cat{font-size:12px;color:var(--text3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.8px;margin-bottom:10px;font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;}
.proc-desc{font-size:14px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:4px;}
.divider{height:1px;background:var(--border);margin:22px 0;}
.block-testo{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#3a3530;margin-bottom:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;}.block-passaggio{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:14px;padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2ddd8;border-radius:12px;}.pass-num{width:28px;height:28px;background:#1a1714;color:#fff;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;}.pass-text{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1a1714;flex:1;white-space:pre-wrap;}.block-lista{margin-bottom:18px;padding-left:0;list-style:none;}.block-lista li{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3a3530;padding:5px 0 5px 22px;position:relative;border-bottom:1px solid #f0ede8;}.block-lista li:last-child{border-bottom:none;}.block-lista li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:6px;top:13px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#c8392b;}.block-immagine{margin-bottom:18px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;}.block-immagine img{width:100%;display:block;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e2ddd8;}.block-video{margin-bottom:18px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;}.block-video iframe{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border:none;display:block;border-radius:12px;}.block-avviso{margin-bottom:18px;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;white-space:pre-wrap;}.avviso-giallo{background:#fff8e8;border:1px solid #f0d080;color:#7a5a00;}.avviso-rosso{background:#fff0f0;border:1px solid #f0a0a0;color:#8a0000;}.avviso-verde{background:#f0fff4;border:1px solid #90d0a0;color:#1a5a2a;}.avviso-blu{background:#f0f8ff;border:1px solid #90c0e0;color:#003a6a;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo"><div class="logo-mark">BB</div><div class="logo-text">Big Ben</div></div>
  <button class="back-btn" onclick="history.back()">&#8592; Indietro</button>
</header>
<div class="container">
<div class="proc-header">
  <span class="proc-icon-big">🔑</span>
  <div class="badge attiva">&#9679; Attiva</div>
  <h1 class="proc-title">Apertura sala sopra</h1>
  <div class="proc-cat">Sala sopra</div>
  <div class="proc-desc">Peocedura di apertura</div>
</div>
<div class="divider"></div>
<ul class="block-lista"><li>- Alzare tutti gli interruttori del quadro elettrico molto lentamente e in modo &quot;verticale&quot; per accendere tutti i giochi e le luci</li></ul><div class="block-immagine"><img src="https://ibb.co/BHHLn1Vq" alt="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.block-immagine').style.display='none'"></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>